Vuesax icons (Iconsax) — third-party licence

The SVG files in icons/svg and the outlines generated from them
(center-windows/Core/IconData.g.cs, center-macos/Sources/CenterCore/IconData.g.swift)
come from the Vuesax icon set, published as Iconsax, in the form rendered by the
npm package iconsax-react 0.0.8 (https://github.com/rendinjast/iconsax-react),
which is released under the MIT licence.

